<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="faq-container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">FAQ</span>
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Everything students and parents need to know about the SXC experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What is SintraX Creations?</summary>
        <p>
          SintraX Creations is a student-powered environment where students
          work on startup-oriented projects, collaborate in teams, build real
          products, and gain practical experience.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Is SXC a job or internship program?</summary>
        <p>
          No. SXC is not a job or internship provider. It is a project-building
          environment focused on practical experience, teamwork, and product
          development.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do students receive a salary or stipend?</summary>
        <p>
          No salary or stipend is guaranteed. SXC focuses on helping students
          gain practical experience and build a strong project portfolio.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Who can join SXC?</summary>
        <p>
          SXC is primarily designed for college students, especially students
          in their 2nd or 3rd year who are interested in technology, startups,
          and product development.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How are projects and teams assigned?</summary>
        <p>
          Students can explore available projects, choose projects that
          interest them, and become part of a suitable team based on project
          requirements and SXC’s evaluation process.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Can students propose their own project ideas?</summary>
        <p>
          Yes. Students may propose their own ideas. SXC will review the idea
          and decide whether it is suitable for the program.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Will students receive a certificate?</summary>
        <p>
          Students who successfully complete their project and meet the
          required expectations will receive an SXC certificate.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Does every project become a startup?</summary>
        <p>
          No. Some projects may explore commercial opportunities, but not every
          project becomes a startup or generates revenue.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What is the refund policy?</summary>
        <p>
          All payments made to SXC are non-refundable. Once the registration or
          program payment has been completed, it cannot be cancelled or
          refunded. Students and parents should review the program details
          carefully before making a payment.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

